Data note: the NYX Aether platform consumes free, publicly accessible data
sources (MLB Stats API, Statcast, The Odds API, Kalshi, Open-Meteo, NOAA)
for research and demonstration purposes. This project is independent and is
not affiliated with, sponsored by, or endorsed by Major League Baseball or
